<B>Parameters of this class are:</B><BR><BR>
<table class="doxtable" border="1" width="100%" cellpadding="4">
<tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Restrictions</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>rt_tolerance</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">float</td><td style="vertical-align:top">5.0</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">min: 0.0</td><td style="vertical-align:top">RT tolerance (in seconds) for the matching</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>mz_tolerance</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">float</td><td style="vertical-align:top">20.0</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">min: 0.0</td><td style="vertical-align:top">m/z tolerance (in ppm or Da) for the matching</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>mz_measure</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">string</td><td style="vertical-align:top">ppm</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">ppm, Da</td><td style="vertical-align:top">unit of 'mz_tolerance' (ppm or Da)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>mz_reference</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">string</td><td style="vertical-align:top">precursor</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">precursor, peptide</td><td style="vertical-align:top">source of m/z values for peptide identifications</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>ignore_charge</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">string</td><td style="vertical-align:top">false</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">true, false</td><td style="vertical-align:top">For feature/consensus maps: Assign an ID independently of whether its charge state matches that of the (consensus) feature.</td>
</tr>
</table>
<br>
